t 3]\n侧面中近景。暴雨顺着面颊滑落，狂风撕扯着湿透的发丝，<Subject1> Kim Min-eun眼神空洞，继续吐出后半句：\n<Subject 1> (S1) says:\n<d>[Korean]우리 같은 사람은 벌레만도 못해.</d>\n\n[Shot 4]\n仰拍全景。话音落下瞬间，<Subject1> Kim Min-eun决绝后仰，身躯瞬间坠入天台下方深不见底的狂风与暴雨夜色中，画面骤然切黑。\n\n【禁止项】\n\n文字/UI/水印/Logo/角标/可读文字/真实UI\n\n【强制声明】\n\n无背景音乐,仅保留环境音与人声和音效;画面禁字幕/文字/水印/Logo;禁止可读文字(指画面字幕文字,不含人声台词)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [420.1754455566406, 508.5965576171875], "pos": [-2276.89306640625, 5671.7255859375], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "value", "links": [318], "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [15], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "INTConstant", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [265.0000305175781, 59.71052551269531], "pos": [-2582.022705078125, 6116.4921875], "id": 163, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "INTConstant"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [10], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (Duration)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [257.0932922363281, 68.39314270019531], "pos": [-2586.975341796875, 5941.94091796875], "id": 132, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for 